{%- render 'glp1-assets' -%}
<div class="g1">
  <section class="g1-sec">
    <div class="g1-wrap">
      <div class="g1-center">
        <div class="g1-eyebrow">Why the usual fixes miss</div>
        <h2 class="g1-h2">Every other fix answers the wrong question.</h2>
      </div>

      <figure class="g1-fig g1-price" style="max-width:860px;margin:36px auto 0">
        <div class="g1-vt">What the wrong answers cost</div>
        <h4>Women on GLP-1s already pay for the shot. Then they pay again for the wrong answer.</h4>
        <div class="g1-hrow g1-shot" title="GLP-1 drug: $200 to $1,000+ a month"><div class="g1-lab">The shot itself</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar" style="width:100%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">$200&#8211;1,000+<span class="g1-tagt">per month</span></div></div>
        <div style="border-top:1px dashed var(--g1-line);margin:14px 0 10px"></div>
        <div class="g1-hrow" title="Nutrafol Women's Balance 45+: $88"><div class="g1-lab">Nutrafol 45+</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar" style="width:88%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">$88<span class="g1-tagt">nutrient gap</span></div></div>
        <div class="g1-hrow" title="IM8: $78 a month"><div class="g1-lab">IM8</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar" style="width:78%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">$78<span class="g1-tagt">nutrient gap</span></div></div>
        <div class="g1-hrow" title="Viviscal: $47"><div class="g1-lab">Viviscal</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar" style="width:47%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">$47<span class="g1-tagt">nutrient gap</span></div></div>
        <div class="g1-hrow" title="WEEM gummies: $34.95"><div class="g1-lab">WEEM gummies</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar" style="width:35%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">$34.95<span class="g1-tagt">nutrient gap</span></div></div>
        <div class="g1-hrow" title="Nature's Bounty Biotin: $8.59"><div class="g1-lab">Biotin</div><div class="g1-track"><div class="g1-bar" style="width:8.6%"></div></div><div class="g1-num">$8.59<span class="g1-tagt">biotin</span></div></div>
        <p class="g1-cap">Listed prices. Not 1 bar is aimed at the growth phase. Sources: Amazon US listings, Oct 2026; IM8 GLP-1 page.</p>
      </figure>

      <div class="g1-fix">
        <div><h3>Biotin</h3><p>Only fixes a biotin shortfall. Most women with this shed have normal labs. The follicles weren't short on supplies. They were switched to rest.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Collagen and protein</h3><p>Hand the follicle building materials. A follicle switched to rest isn't building anything. Spermidine is the signal to keep building.</p></div>
        <div><h3>DHT blockers</h3><p>Saw palmetto and pumpkin seed are made for pattern baldness, a hormone problem. The Famine Shed isn't a hormone problem. Spermidine leaves hormones alone.</p></div>
        <div><h3>Minoxidil</h3><p>A prescription or a greasy scalp, the "dread shed" at the start, and a habit for life. Spermidine is a capsule <span class="g1-gap">[GAP: confirm format]</span> with no dread shed.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="g1-tablebox">
        <table class="g1-vs">
          <thead><tr><th></th><th class="g1-us">[BRAND] Spermidine</th><th>Biotin</th><th>DHT blockers</th><th>Minoxidil</th><th>Collagen / protein</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Works on the real cause (follicles leaving the growth phase)</td><td class="g1-us">&#10003;</td><td class="g1-no">&#10005;</td><td class="g1-no">&#10005;</td><td>Different lever</td><td class="g1-no">&#10005;</td></tr>
            <tr><td>No hormones, no DHT blocking</td><td class="g1-us">&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td class="g1-no">&#10005;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td></tr>
            <tr><td>No prescription</td><td class="g1-us">&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td>Oral: &#10005;</td><td>&#10003;</td></tr>
            <tr><td>No "dread shed" at the start</td><td class="g1-us">&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td class="g1-no">&#10005;</td><td>&#10003;</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Works alongside the shot</td><td class="g1-us">&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td><td>&#10003;</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

